# Product rules

- Stack: Node.js + Express + MongoDB (backend), React (frontend)
- Roles: CUSTOMER (users collection) | ADMIN (admins collection; farmer = admin)
- Auth: customer `/api/auth/otp/*`, admin `/api/auth/admin/*`; phone unique across both tables
- OTP is printed in the terminal until Twilio is enabled
- Backend owns price, stock, totals. Never trust frontend money/qty.
- Order status: PLACED → CONFIRMED → HARVESTING → PACKED → OUT_FOR_DELIVERY → DELIVERED | CANCELLED
- Harvest quantities come from real orders, not Stitch sample numbers
